    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The Pledgor has full capacity for civil conduct and has the lawful right and capacity to enter into this Agreement and to assume legal obligations under this Agreement. This Agreement, upon due execution by the Pledgor, constitutes legal, valid and binding obligations of the Pledgor.</FONT></TD></TR>
