    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Other than the Pledge, the Pledgor has not created any security interest or other encumbrance over the Pledged Equity.</FONT></TD></TR>
