    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">save as expressly provided in Section 6.1.1, the Pledgor transfers or intends to transfer or abandon the Pledged Equity, or assigns the Pledged Equity without the written consent of the Pledgee;</FONT></TD></TR>
